  "fixture_adjustments": [
    "The first steer run recorded the control and recovered its receipt. The terminal split the receipt reference across output frames. The retry used a wider ConPTY.",
    "Steer2 and interrupt1 verified the intended operation, cancellation and persisted result. Both failed the contiguous result-text assertion after reattach. The final probe verifies frames from the original owner and checks the result in the unique native history of the isolated project independently.",
    "Steer3 used an internal host ID as a native history filename. Interrupt2 attempted queue resume before a fresh capability revision was available. Both fixture assumptions were corrected.",
    "The first embedded attempt omitted the repository namespace needed by the disposable setup helpers. The second omitted the fixture Server ID in the operator client and was refused before attachment.",
    "The third embedded attempt recorded both native controls. Its assertion expected an empty queue after the replacement turn was cancelled. The final probe checks the exact durable unresolved input count and binds outstanding input to the replacement operation."
  ],
